[{"title":"和宋永兄围棋青字韵因成五绝 其四","author":"黄公度","text":"哲匠观旁嘿若喑，衔枚勇士用功深。\n管中窥豹谁家子，技痒时时不自禁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70741,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宋永兄围棋青字韵因成五绝 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"翻劫解围心有兵，谋生政要眼双青。\n已收鹅阵乌巢幕，未放鹰扬鸥满汀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70742,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宋永兄围棋青字韵因成五绝 其五","author":"黄公度","text":"千里归来两鬓丝，清风永日对枯棋。\n红尘万事不到眼，此乐勿容儿辈知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70743,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宋永兄围棋青字韵因成五绝 其三","author":"黄公度","text":"一胜一负乃常事，七纵七擒真妙机。\n九械难窥墨翟守，六奇终破白登围。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70744,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宋永兄爱日楼见寄八首 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"陈楼高卧真佳士，陶径归来有古风。\n只恐功名不相放，驱人须作黑头公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70745,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宋永兄爱日楼见寄八首 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"画图展处千山雪，渔艇归时一笛风。\n为爱东溟日色好，侧身楼外望壶公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70746,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宋永兄罢官还家途中见寄四绝 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"流年忽忽双蓬鬓，薄宦纷纷一旅亭。\n惟有长官衫色在，至今犹与眼俱青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70747,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宋永兄罢官还家途中见寄四绝 其四","author":"黄公度","text":"不比人心惊岁移，且看雁影逐春归。\n明朝已办椒花颂，相对一尊忘是非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宋永兄罢官还家途中见寄四绝 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"三年惠政留岩邑，千里归舟犯恶滩。\n乌鹊信传知渐近，白鸥盟在未应寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宋永兄罢官还家途中见寄四绝 其三","author":"黄公度","text":"知稼堂中一味閒，卷帘终日卧看山。\n虽无微禄供贫病，幸有新诗伴往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑山铺用实之韵","author":"黄公度","text":"一溪清浅抱山根，山雾溪烟白昼昏。\n负郭可能无五斗，肩舆何事走空村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赴南恩道间和杨体南三首 其三","author":"黄公度","text":"白鸥应怪旧盟寒，斗粟低佪真强颜。\n更度桑乾隔并土，不堪回首旧家山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70752,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赴南恩道间和杨体南三首 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"身任东西南北居，心安到处即吾庐。\n穷途俗眼休相薄，沮洳焉知无大鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70753,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其四","author":"黄公度","text":"亲舆昔侍角方总，使节今持鬓未苍。\n竹马儿童半相识，分明遗爱在甘棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70754,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"遐陬赤子困侵牟，跳弄潢池今几秋。\n从此声威憺强梗，自然戈戟变锄耰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70755,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其五","author":"黄公度","text":"早晚芝函下九天，不容瓜戍更期年。\n苍生属望为霖久，肯使炎方雨露偏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70756,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其六","author":"黄公度","text":"闻道韶阳一亩宫，居民奉祀曲江公。\n凭君到日酹尊酒，酝藉风流事事同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70757,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其三","author":"黄公度","text":"石门酌水赋新诗，旧事曾闻吴隐之。\n习习清风化贪懦，不图今见古齐夷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70758,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其八","author":"黄公度","text":"千里江山一雁声，广文官舍冷如冰。\n祁奚若未忘公举，魏戊犹堪备内称。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70759,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其九","author":"黄公度","text":"新息功名晚始收，送君今去跕鸢州。\n男儿未上云台画，莫念平生马少游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70760,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其七","author":"黄公度","text":"怪底青云懒著鞭，年来馀事觉真诠。\n圜扉昼辟庭无讼，时访曹溪六祖禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70761,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"九重仁圣不忘远，庶狱哀矜轸虑深。\n本恕定知黄霸用，无刑端契有虞心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70762,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送外兄方卿公美赴广东宪十绝 其十","author":"黄公度","text":"十里红旗拥使星，一杯绿蚁话长亭。\n明朝车马各南北，谁唱阳关且细听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70763,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽方宋贤四绝 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"千年忠孝归图画，百卷风骚动冕旒。\n一尉南州成底事，可怜夜壑遽移舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70764,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽方宋贤四绝 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"少年挟策上皇都，晚岁论功向石渠。\n犹忆微才在天禄，铅丹曾为校遗书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70765,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽方宋贤四绝 其三","author":"黄公度","text":"管辂相无壬甲寿，郑玄梦告己辰年。\n收书恨未齐东观，作记虚传上九天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70766,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽方宋贤四绝 其四","author":"黄公度","text":"平生好尚流俗表，无数交游气槩中。\n未觉门前车辙少，阿戎清赏有浑风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70767,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"黄公度","text":"野鸟春布谷，阶虫秋络丝。\n呶呶空过耳，终不救寒饥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70768,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮春山间","author":"黄公度","text":"缓步春山春日长，流莺不语燕飞忙。\n桃花落处无人见，濯手惟闻涧水香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70769,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"镊白","author":"黄公度","text":"昨夜庭梧满意凉，秋风不贷鬓边霜。\n等閒镊白了时节，书策纵横日上廊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70770,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题分水岭两绝 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"呜咽泉流万仞峰，断肠从此各西东。\n谁知不作多时别，依旧相逢沧海中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70771,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题分水岭两绝 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"闽越江南此地分，鲍娘诗句尚能存。\n客怀未觉今宵好，家住壶山烟雨村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70772,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题化度寺竹间亭","author":"黄公度","text":"羸骖踏遍乱山青，薄宦羁人醉未醒。\n破午停鞭得幽寺，眼明初见竹间亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70773,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题须江驿诗后","author":"黄公度","text":"归来已负百花期，閒拂尘埃看旧诗。\n极目平芜二千里，乡心惟有杜鹃知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70774,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题紫溪驿","author":"黄公度","text":"离家一月断家书，家在闽山深处居。\n路入江南隔分水，山犹不见况吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70775,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题瘦牛岭","author":"黄公度","text":"自笑年来为食谋，扶携百指过南州。\n时平四野皆青草，此地何曾解瘦牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70776,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题翠峰寺西轩","author":"黄公度","text":"寂寂春葩映短墙，半山松竹奏笙簧。\n无情幽鸟背人去，不惯村童笑客狂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70777,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题潮阳石塔寺","author":"黄公度","text":"投檄真成出瘴乡，篮舆渐喜到僧坊。\n长风解事吹江雨，乞与行人五月凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70778,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠日者黄明远","author":"黄公度","text":"幅巾别我五周星，今日相逢眼暂明。\n一第男儿身自致，曾将踪迹问君平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70779,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乙亥岁除渔梁村","author":"黄公度","text":"年来似觉道途熟，老去空更岁月频。\n爆竹一声乡梦破，残灯永夜客愁新。\n云容山意商量雪，柳眼桃腮领略春。\n想得在家小儿女，地炉相对说行人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70780,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"黄公度","text":"天涯霜露羁离久，海内风尘归思赊。\n万里穷途双白鬓，一尊浊酒对黄花。\n频年奔走哀王粲，落日登临忆孟嘉。\n绝塞欢娱易萧瑟，悲来忍泪望京华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70781,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月三十日郊外即事","author":"黄公度","text":"雨积稻畦白，晴添麦垄黄。\n野桥排雁齿，山路转羊肠。\n鸟语有时好，田家随事忙。\n一年春尽日，身迹更他乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70782,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与方稚川","author":"黄公度","text":"南来厌见跕飞鸢，之子相逢意凛然。\n未用天涯叹沦落，要知幕府盛才贤。\n清谭霏屑论交地，叠鼓喧江送别筵。\n帆腹渐肥人渐远，离愁长在夕阳边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70783,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久不得浙耗","author":"黄公度","text":"独酌浇愁酒，慵翻信手书。\n折腰行俗吏，投足且吾庐。\n岁月莺声老，江湖雁影疏。\n依栖五侯第，旅食近何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70784,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久雨阻西郊之游","author":"黄公度","text":"忽忽春将半，冥冥雨未休。\n过从喧屐齿，追赏负觥筹。\n诗句那排闷，莺声巧唤愁。\n晴郊饶胜槩，何日许同游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70785,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大水二首 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"洚水应垂儆，高穹岂不仁。\n发陈遵故事，执咎定何人。\n岸落溪容改，山摧土色新。\n伤心问耆旧，谁与吊斯民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70786,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大水二首 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"巨浸滔天后，遗黎复业初。\n桑田皆变海，老稚半为鱼。\n凿石开新道，行人问故庐。\n客愁那对此，搔首重欷歔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70787,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行即事二首 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"席改尊犹在，心閒屐自迟。\n角巾攲短树，风带罥疏篱。\n作难忧胡羯，全生混野麋。\n晚来幽意惬，归路恐多岐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70788,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行即事二首 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"落石奔沙岸，颓云拥树根。\n牛羊千古道，鸡犬数家村。\n风递邻舂急，春归农事繁。\n生涯随处乐，翁妪话柴门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70789,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"己巳九日陪陆使君宴共乐台和庄倅韵","author":"黄公度","text":"一年秋色垂垂老，九日寒花处处同。\n落帽何人羞短发，危台向晚易高风。\n黄云万顷峰峦下，白雪几声宵汉中。\n陌上行人尽回首，使君开宴在层空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70790,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日次良翰韵","author":"黄公度","text":"老去低徊强北游，春来消息望南州。\n别离况复年华换，富贵难令少壮留。\n行李未知何处定，屠苏还解忆人不。\n可堪一夜寒江雨，滴作羁怀万斛愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70791,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午睡起得富沙信","author":"黄公度","text":"閒处工夫要破除，茅堂一枕黑甜馀。\n漆园栩栩看成蝶，边笥便便旧贮书。\n扫尽机心还罔象，了无行迹便华胥。\n故人千里能知我，远寄月团供燕居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70792,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬戌中秋沿檄行县与龚实之同宿于琴泉轩","author":"黄公度","text":"摇落江城暮，招提访旧游。\n泉声终夜雨，竹影一堂秋。\n露湛衣裳冷，山空枕簟幽。\n故人怜寂寞，抱被肯相投。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70793,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方帅务德生朝三首 其三","author":"黄公度","text":"高门馀庆自绵绵，唾手功名不作难。\n况是胸中绝畦町，更于笔下富波澜。\n家传元老谋猷壮，人乐将军礼数宽。\n香火祝公千百寿，姓名高并斗星寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70794,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方帅务德生朝三首 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"一别帝城今几秋，忧时不复为身谋。\n枌榆故国三千里，桃李新阴四十州。\n谈笑折冲无鼠辈，平生推毂尽清流。\n急须整顿乾坤了，鸣玉槐庭要黑头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70795,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方帅务德生朝三首 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"一气潜回万物春，星躔降昴岳生申。\n钓台今古风流在，梅岭东西雨露均。\n再拥朱轓专节制，久虚清禁待经纶。\n衮衣莫讶公归晚，要使遐荒识凤麟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70796,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方次云伏枕久不入城独宿知稼堂有怀","author":"黄公度","text":"吹笛清宵何处声，隔窗斜月听人行。\n梦回案上青荧火，魂断城头长短更。\n三伏故人怜卧病，百年薄宦任浮生。\n春风尚忆茅堂话，相对哦诗天未明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70797,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙霞道中阻雨","author":"黄公度","text":"薄暮雨霏霏，归心恨不飞。\n客程三日阻，家舍半年违。\n涧涩水争道，山空云触衣。\n凭谁洗光手，取出太阳辉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70798,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬日道间","author":"黄公度","text":"岁熟牛羊饱，村寒鸟兽呼。\n霜馀山骨露，水落涧毛枯。\n归艇收渔网，行人问酒垆。\n微躯任南北，未觉旅怀孤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70799,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正月晦日寄宋永兄","author":"黄公度","text":"万事萦心空岁月，一分春色已尘埃。\n檐前雨脚何时断，陌上遨头几日来。\n寒束幽花如有待，风延啼鸟苦相催。\n明年此会各南北，趁取官閒共酒杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70800,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春日有感","author":"黄公度","text":"三见春归人未归，天涯依旧赋春诗。\n一官得失不相补，万事乘除只自知。\n年去年来供屈指，岭南岭北入支颐。\n柳眉桃脸竞时节，难遣东风染鬓丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70801,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会同年共乐台","author":"黄公度","text":"兰省三千士，莆阳十五人。\n此时乡曲会，异日庙堂身。\n名塞乾坤隘，恩沾雨露新。\n天边三雁远，回首独凝神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70802,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再用韵","author":"黄公度","text":"斗粟驱人堕世纷，卯申凫鹜动成群。\n桁杨閒卧吏休日，尊俎清谭士集云。\n久矣蛮荒真下策，信哉邹鲁号多文。\n酒酣预约鸡豚社，会见婆娑故国枌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70803,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再用韵书怀","author":"黄公度","text":"行行渐入瘴乡深，官事从人笑我侵。\n越俎代庖真有愧，逢场作戏本无心。\n宾僚暇日一杯酒，杖屦西园十亩阴。\n政尔无能落閒处，且从猿鸟觅知音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70804,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再别郑叔友兼寄方次云","author":"黄公度","text":"鞍马侵三伏，萍蓬寄一身。\n及秋归计早，到日附书频。\n炎岭休长客，清漳有故人。\n过逢如问信，为道各埃尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70805,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏集老杜句再和","author":"黄公度","text":"背堂资僻远，要路亦高深。\n未负幽栖志，回看不住心。\n寒花隐乱草，飞鸟度层阴。\n独绕荒斋径，新诗近玉琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70806,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早发东城迓宪车","author":"黄公度","text":"五更驱倦仆，发轫古城边。\n月色潮初上，钟声人正眠。\n自怜筋力在，无补岁时迁。\n远愧陶彭泽，归心独浩然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70807,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早发延福道间偶作录呈","author":"黄公度","text":"夜宿姜峰寺，晓投刘店村。\n秋光随杖屦，逸兴满郊原。\n短句时时得，何人细细论。\n凤凰山下约，回首欲飞翻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70808,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次云见过留宿有诗因赓其韵二首 其二","author":"黄公度","text":"惜别情无赖，狂吟意有馀。\n琴尊閒院落，花柳暗村墟。\n行乐真聊尔，论交莫后予。\n裹粮山下约，来往未应疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70809,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次云见过留宿有诗因赓其韵二首 其一","author":"黄公度","text":"茅舍嚣尘外，青灯笑语中。\n相逢今夕款，忽忆去年同。\n瓶涩倾无绿，炉寒拨更红。\n卧闻窗雨响，檐溜受斜风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70810,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次师白弟元日韵","author":"黄公度","text":"且看时事惬心期，莫为流年作许悲。\n足慰羁愁缘雁序，恐无奇策对龙墀。\n梅妆已觉香全减，柳线相将绿四垂。\n腊雪渐消春又到，人间底事不潜移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70811,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]